<title> Steatohepatitis: Management.</title>
<graphic href="eee0221-w0001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>Persistent Liver Enzyme Elevation</label>
<path target="cell-2"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-2">
<label>Viral serology (anti-HBc IgM, HBsAg, anti-HCV), ANA, serum transferrin saturation, ferritin</label>
<path target="cell-3">Abnormal</path>
<path target="cell-4">Normal</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-3">
<label>Evaluate and treat for possible viral hepatitis, autoimmune hepatitis, or hemochromocytosis</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-4">
<label>Assess alcohol intake: Two drinks or more per day?</label>
<path target="cell-5">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-6">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-5">
<label>Alcoholic liver disease likely</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-6">
<label>Steatosis present on ultrasound or CT?</label>
<path target="cell-8">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-7">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-7">
<label>Consider referral and possible liver biopsy</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-8">
<label>Nonalcoholic fatty liver disease likely</label>
</cell>
</algorithm>
</algorithms>
